# Build context speedup for Render / Cloud Run docker builds.
# Only apps/api/ is the docker context, but a top-level .dockerignore catches stray pulls.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.dart_tool
**/.flutter-plugins*

# Don't ship local env files into the image
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Test scaffolding + docs
**/tests/.coverage
**/htmlcov
*.md
LICENSE
.git
.github
.tmp
.vscode
.idea
